.TH EGGHEAD-CONFIG 1 "April 2026" "egghead 0.1.0" "Egghead Manual"
.SH NAME
egghead-config \- view and edit configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B egghead config
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
View and modify Egghead configuration. Config is stored in YAML at
.I ~/.config/egghead/config.yml
(respects
.BR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME ).
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B (default)
Show current configuration.
.TP
.B set \fIkey\fR \fIvalue\fR
Set a config value using dot-path notation.
.TP
.B path
Print the config file path.
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIPATH\fR
Override config file location.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
egghead config
egghead config path
egghead config set web.port 8080
egghead config set default_model anthropic/claude\-opus\-4\-6
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR egghead-init (1),
.BR egghead-doctor (1),
.BR egghead (5),
.BR egghead (1)
